# Scratch space for DAST runs. Contains the generated DAST-safe OpenAPI document
# and the ZAP reports, both of which are build outputs, and the reports can
# contain request and response bodies from a scan against staging. This
# repository is public, so nothing from here is ever committed.
zap/work/

# Generated by security/bola/route-matrix.mjs from the OpenAPI spec. Derived,
# not authored: committing it would create a second source of truth that can
# disagree with the spec, which is the exact failure the enumerator exists to
# prevent.
bola/route-matrix.json
